OL,3,CParts of country may hit 38C as fire
OL,4,Cunion chief warns of 'national
OL,5,Cemergency'
OL,7,FParts of the UK could be set to bake
OL,8,Fin 38C temperatures as a firefighters'
OL,9,Funion chief warned the country faces a
OL,10,F"national emergency" over wildfires.
OL,12,FSome areas face a fifth heatwave of
OL,13,Fthe summer, as the Met Office revealed
OL,14,Fthe UK is on course for its hottest
OL,15,Fsummer on record.
OL,26,@rD@AOUrD@TO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/11
