OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786506479
OL,3,CParts of country may hit 38C as fire
OL,4,Cunion chief warns of 'national
OL,5,Cemergency'
OL,7,FRare amber "extreme heat" warnings
OL,8,Fhave been issued by the forecaster for
OL,9,FLondon and parts of the South East,
OL,10,FEast Midlands, East of England, West
OL,11,FMidlands and South Yorkshire from 9am
OL,12,Fto midnight on Thursday.
OL,14,FTemperatures could hit 33C on
OL,15,FWednesday before potentially reaching
OL,16,Fhighs of 37C or 38C on Thursday, the
OL,17,FMet Office say.
OL,26,@oD@LOUoD@YO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
